@startuml
!theme plain
hide footbox
autonumber "<b>(0)</b>"

' --- STILE VISIVO ---
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #2C3E50
    LifeLineBorderColor #2C3E50
    LifeLineBackgroundColor White
    ParticipantBorderColor #2C3E50
    ParticipantBackgroundColor White
    ParticipantFontName Helvetica
    ParticipantFontSize 14
    ParticipantFontStyle bold
    BoxFontSize 16
    BoxFontColor White
}

' --- ATTORI ---

box "Simulation Layer (The World Engine)" #4A90E2
    participant "World State\n(In-Memory)" as World
    participant "Sense Interface\n(Translator)" as Sense
    participant "Rules Oracle" as Oracle
end box

box "Data Layer" #95A5A6
    database "Log Repository\n(Episodic Memory)" as DB
end box

box "Cognitive Layer (The Brain)" #27AE60
    participant "Nation Agent\n(Cabinet)" as Agent
end box


' --- INIZIO FLUSSO ---

== Phase 1: Sense (Data Fusion) ==

' 1. DATI REAL-TIME (Dalla RAM)
World -> Sense : Fetch **Current State** (RAM)
note left
  Dati vivi (Runtime):
  - Voronoi Graph (Topology)
  - Resources & Budget
  - Current Trust Matrix
end note

activate Sense

' 2. DATI STORICI (Dal DB) - NUOVO!
Sense -> DB : Query **Recent History** (SQL)
note right
  Recupera eventi passati:
  - "Last 5 turns summary"
  - "Active Grievances"
  (Context window optimization)
end note

' 3. FUSIONE
Sense -> Sense : **Synthesize Intelligence**
note right
  Data Fusion:
  - Integra Topologia (RAM)
  - con Memoria Storica (DB)
end note

' 4. INPUT FINALE
Sense -> Agent : <b>Inject Strategic Context</b>
note right
  Report completo per l'LLM:
  "Sei ricco (RAM) ma isolato diplomaticamente
  perché hai tradito la Nazione B al turno 4 (DB)."
end note
deactivate Sense

== Phase 2: Think (Reasoning) ==

activate Agent
Agent -> Agent : <b>Cabinet Deliberation</b>
note right of Agent
  Il sistema multi-agente elabora:
  1. Ministri analizzano il report misto
  2. Opinione Pubblica fornisce polls
  3. Presidente bilancia il budget
  *(Eventuale query DB specifica qui se serve)*
end note

Agent -> Oracle : <b>Submit Diplomatic Envelope</b>
note right
  Contiene il <b>Multi-Payload</b>:
  - Military Vector (Priority List)
  - Azione Economica
  - Azione Estera
end note
deactivate Agent

== Phase 3: Act (Validation & Execution) ==

activate Oracle
Oracle -> Oracle : <b>Validate Constraints</b>
note left
  Verifica sequenziale:
  1. Check Opinione Pubblica
  2. Check Budget Totale
  3. Check Fattibilità Fisica
end note

Oracle -> World : <b>Execute State Changes</b>
note left: Modifica lo stato in RAM:\nConfini, Risorse, Trust

== Phase 4: Trace (Logging) ==

Oracle -> DB : <b>Archive Turn Data</b>
note right: Salva lo snapshot e le decisioni\nper memoria futura ed Explainability

World -> World : Advance Turn
deactivate Oracle

@enduml